OL,3,ASearch and rescue teams race against   
OL,4,Atime to find survivors after Nigeria   
OL,5,Aboat tragedy                           
OL,7,FNigerian search and rescue teams are   
OL,8,Fracing against time to find survivors  
OL,9,Fafter a boat carrying mourners         
OL,10,Ftravelling to a funeral capsized on    
OL,11,FFriday.                                
OL,13,FTwenty-nine bodies have been recovered 
OL,14,Fand 50 people rescued so far, a        
OL,15,Fspokesperson for the National Emergency
OL,16,FManagement Agency (Nema) told the BBC. 
OL,18,FThe government has responded by        
OL,19,Fordering stricter enforcement of safety
OL,20,Fstandards on the country's inland      
OL,21,Fwaterways.                             
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
